From: junkyard
Subject: [PATCH] gpu: port to Linux 6.18 (lynx)

Port private/google-modules/gpu to the GrapheneOS Linux 6.18 GKI for the gs201 lynx build.
Mechanical API migrations, no intended behaviour change:

  - platform_driver.remove returns void (6.11)
  - del_timer*() renamed timer_delete*() (6.15)
  - MODULE_IMPORT_NS() takes a string literal (6.13)
  - drop in-tree-only include paths that -Wmissing-include-dirs now rejects
  - mali: driver-owned movable pages removed (6.17): page migration forced off,
    __SetPageMovable/__ClearPageMovable stubbed (ACK already defaulted it off)

17 files.

lynx-only (kernel/patches-lynx/): felix builds the 6.1 tree these
drivers were written for.
